    {
      "text": "Tales are told of ships that wander into seas where Dragalge live, never to return.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "This vicious Pokémon sprays a poisonous liquid on opponents that come near. For whatever reason, it gets along really well with Dhelmise.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It blends in with seaweed to ambush its prey and then takes them down with a poisonous liquid strong enough to melt metal.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dragalge uses a poisonous liquid capable of corroding metal to send tankers that enter its territory to the bottom of the sea.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dragalge generates dragon energy by sticking the plume on its head out above the ocean’s surface and bathing it in sunlight.",
